DEVICE VS WEB — FEEDBACK TYPE ROUTING (BINDING)

\================================================================================



Principle

\- Structured Feedback with diagnostics exists only
inside the installed app.

\- The website and Help KB may offer mailto for
human-written messages — never silent log upload, never web forms that attach
project data or diagnostics.

\- Bug reports that support can act on require
on-device context; web cannot substitute.



